{"title":"Research Associate Roadmap","role":"Research Associate","summary":"A Research Associate in genetic counselling and medical biotechnology supports biomedical and genetics-focused research involving human health, inherited disorders, molecular diagnostics, genomics, and patient-related datasets.","facts":{"Current degree":"Allied Health Sciences (B.Sc / BPT / BOT / BMLT etc.)","Course":"Genetic Counselling / Medical Biotechnology"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Research Associate in genetic counselling and medical biotechnology supports biomedical and genetics-focused research involving human health, inherited disorders, molecular diagnostics, genomics, and patient-related datasets."},{"type":"p","text":"The role can involve laboratory research, clinical research, genetic-data analysis, literature review, sample processing, research documentation and scientific reporting, depending on the organization and the candidate's exact qualification."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical work environments include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Biotechnology companies"},{"text":"Genetic testing laboratories"},{"text":"Medical research institutes"},{"text":"Hospitals"},{"text":"Universities"},{"text":"Pharmaceutical companies"},{"text":"Clinical research organizations"},{"text":"Genomics companies"},{"text":"Public-health research organizations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Research Associate title can have different eligibility requirements. Some laboratory-intensive positions may prefer or require a relevant MSc/MTech/PG qualification, while bachelor's graduates may enter through research assistant, project assistant, laboratory associate or trainee positions."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Focus","Key Capabilities"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Biology & genetics foundation"},{"te